{"3842770": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "The Last Village", "steam_appid": 3842770, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Last Village</strong> is a third-person, single-player Viking survival RPG where you must defend the last Norse settlement against rising waves of undead horrors. Explore by day, survive by night, and uncover the dark mystery behind a cursed portal that's unleashing chaos upon your homeland.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Real-Time Melee Combat</strong><br>Equip swords, axes, and daggers to attack, block, and dodge in fast-paced, skill-based battles. Critical hits and combo moves can turn the tide.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Village Defense System</strong><br>Recruit and command NPC warriors. Assign archers to towers and melee fighters to gates. Use the War Table to plan your defense.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story-Driven Quest System</strong><br>Unravel the mystery of the Draughts and the cursed portal through quests and narrative-driven interactions with villagers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Inventory &amp; Crafting</strong><br>Buy, collect, and equip powerful items. Heal with food, enhance combat with gear, and manage what you carry in a functional inventory UI.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Can You Save the Last Village?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The attacks will never stop. The nights will grow darker. Only the strong and the clever will survive long enough to destroy the portal and save what’s left of your people.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Last Village</strong> is a third-person, single-player Viking survival RPG where you must defend the last Norse settlement against rising waves of undead horrors. Explore by day, survive by night, and uncover the dark mystery behind a cursed portal that's unleashing chaos upon your homeland.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Real-Time Melee Combat</strong><br>Equip swords, axes, and daggers to attack, block, and dodge in fast-paced, skill-based battles. Critical hits and combo moves can turn the tide.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Village Defense System</strong><br>Recruit and command NPC warriors. Assign archers to towers and melee fighters to gates. Use the War Table to plan your defense.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story-Driven Quest System</strong><br>Unravel the mystery of the Draughts and the cursed portal through quests and narrative-driven interactions with villagers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Inventory &amp; Crafting</strong><br>Buy, collect, and equip powerful items. Heal with food, enhance combat with gear, and manage what you carry in a functional inventory UI.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Can You Save the Last Village?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The attacks will never stop. The nights will grow darker. Only the strong and the clever will survive long enough to destroy the portal and save what’s left of your people.</p>", "short_description": "The Last Village is a third-person Viking survival RPG where you build defenses, train warriors, and battle undead enemies each night. Explore by day, survive by night, and uncover the dark mystery behind a cursed portal threatening your homeland.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3842770/d905af84cba9ba51428fc2fd16d8b8141c4ee36e/header.jpg?t=1762557202", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3842770/73d5e1e1911c5c43408fbcd0f10727971f36de76/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762557202", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steams